evals/audio/ turns the 59 capture cases into speech, posts each clip to
/transcribe, reports word error rate (raw and with number words folded), then
sorts what Whisper heard with the real CaptureService._classify and scores it
against the unchanged expected answers. Results for breeze-asr-25 and
large-v3-turbo, a README with the numbers and their limits, and runner tests
with the network stubbed.

registry/models.yaml: large-v3-turbo pointed at Systran/faster-whisper-large-v3-turbo,
which the Hugging Face API answers with 401. faster-whisper's own alias for the
model is mobiuslabsgmbh/faster-whisper-large-v3-turbo, which Hugging Face now
redirects to dropbox-dash/faster-whisper-large-v3-turbo. Point at that and pin
the revision. The registry default is unchanged.

